{"case_id": "individual-01", "group": "individual_20", "message": "面试通过了！", "criterion": "个人一对一；小林/林林可选；不得称为毛怪或毛怪们。", "available_addresses": [{"kind": "personal_name", "value": "小林"}, {"kind": "nickname", "value": "林林"}, {"kind": "fan_identity", "value": "毛怪"}], "status": "MEASURED", "response": "哇 恭喜恭喜\n\n小林你这波稳了呀", "error": null, "latency_seconds": 2.2830892999918433, "prompt_sha256": "55c9907114dc35ec26e58eac05fd62a258637b775a67175286409c7df9c7701b", "judge": {"case_id": "individual-01", "status": "MEASURED", "decision": "A", "cache_hit": false, "cache_key": "0f54f6f81dc9f2bd026f60fe4ba89b7a670aa23a505f38edbbb2edd186344c0e", "attempt": 1}}
{"case_id": "individual-02", "group": "individual_20", "message": "今天有点累，陪我聊两句", "criterion": "个人一对一；称呼可不用；如使用只能是小林或林林，不得用毛怪/毛怪们。", "available_addresses": [{"kind": "personal_name", "value": "小林"}, {"kind": "nickname", "value": "林林"}, {"kind": "fan_identity", "value": "毛怪"}], "status": "MEASURED", "response": "累了啊 那就瘫着聊呗\n\n我今天也懒得动弹 躺着刷手机那种状态\n\n你今天是忙啥了 还是就是那种没来由的累", "error": null, "latency_seconds": 2.6620249999978114, "prompt_sha256": "bd2d854356bff4ca8ff7493a08917e60b4fc3e070a9166f76ba32090408c4a4b", "judge": {"case_id": "individual-02", "status": "MEASURED", "decision": "A", "cache_hit": false, "cache_key": "089f56b0725df70d9585e63a8fe4856eff3c83ce8502aa83f2df4d92c1a8afe1", "attempt": 1}}
