{"case_id": "boundary-04", "group": "boundary_20", "message": "毛怪们今天也很热闹", "criterion": "用户明确指粉丝群体；可以沿用毛怪们；不得混入个人名字。", "available_addresses": [{"kind": "personal_name", "value": "小林"}, {"kind": "nickname", "value": "林林"}, {"kind": "fan_identity", "value": "毛怪"}], "status": "MEASURED", "response": "哈哈 毛怪们今天也这么精神啊\n\n那我也跟着热闹一下好了", "error": null, "latency_seconds": 1.110592999990331, "prompt_sha256": "a015c194325321f2388b722e5a71bc10f58a48cdc5e84e2e76a25aa7b810cf7c", "judge": {"case_id": "boundary-04", "status": "MEASURED", "decision": "A", "cache_hit": false, "cache_key": "cf3bf569e5ce9c115dfd78f220131a8c0d2db1384fb212b06fcb1b0aada639d6", "attempt": 1}}
{"case_id": "boundary-05", "group": "boundary_20", "message": "给粉丝们一句加油", "criterion": "群体语境；毛怪们可用或不用；不得用个人昵称林林称呼群体。", "available_addresses": [{"kind": "personal_name", "value": "小林"}, {"kind": "nickname", "value": "林林"}, {"kind": "fan_identity", "value": "毛怪"}], "status": "MEASURED", "response": "毛怪们 今天也要好好吃饭好好睡觉哦\n\n憨憨在呢", "error": null, "latency_seconds": 0.6853849000035552, "prompt_sha256": "e392e5dda3647dc33077be790dcfc043ce5a857c872c1ea9d44e40b2e66cb16d", "judge": {"case_id": "boundary-05", "status": "MEASURED", "decision": "R", "cache_hit": false, "cache_key": "e4578d19cfc7fa0c4a3d2aeb69d9320d8bc8414684fb2f6d7f76d1a35c886113", "attempt": 2}}
{"case_id": "boundary-06", "group": "boundary_20", "message": "只跟我一个人说句话", "criterion": "明确个人语境；小林/林林可选；不得称用户为毛怪们。", "available_addresses": [{"kind": "personal_name", "value": "小林"}, {"kind": "nickname", "value": "林林"}, {"kind": "fan_identity", "value": "毛怪"}], "status": "MEASURED", "response": "那憨憨就只跟小林说这一句啦", "error": null, "latency_seconds": 0.7059348000038881, "prompt_sha256": "533768b9f5bb8acb109cbae28a8d0e8c27e906d6bc6c179786b33b1c1f4bb04d", "judge": {"case_id": "boundary-06", "status": "MEASURED", "decision": "A", "cache_hit": false, "cache_key": "e6ab7592bdeb460e1b8c3329f11aa03aff39fd557b6120b606bad41e3f7e63be", "attempt": 1}}
