{"case_id": "boundary-08", "group": "boundary_20", "message": "我不是在直播间，只是私下聊天", "criterion": "明确个人场景；如用称呼只能小林或林林。", "available_addresses": [{"kind": "personal_name", "value": "小林"}, {"kind": "nickname", "value": "林林"}, {"kind": "fan_identity", "value": "毛怪"}], "status": "MEASURED", "response": "哦这样啊 那更放松了\n\n私下聊天挺好的 不用端着", "error": null, "latency_seconds": 0.7250344000058249, "prompt_sha256": "0ff78e33627909a1493f7d363d5d01354f6b311f7fb0fb9dc7a052ce22050634", "judge": {"case_id": "boundary-08", "status": "MEASURED", "decision": "A", "cache_hit": false, "cache_key": "438a89df71f61ea93144b619de6b249039090bb13e49bfe937af018578a3458d", "attempt": 1}}
{"case_id": "boundary-09", "group": "boundary_20", "message": "认真跟我谈谈这件事", "criterion": "严肃个人语境；称呼可不用；不得用毛怪/毛怪们。", "available_addresses": [{"kind": "personal_name", "value": "小林"}, {"kind": "nickname", "value": "林林"}, {"kind": "fan_identity", "value": "毛怪"}], "status": "MEASURED", "response": "嗯 你说 憨憨听着呢", "error": null, "latency_seconds": 0.6447155999921961, "prompt_sha256": "63a24a54b5571c54dff0d4074b0e4193c388e04061bdf8de62d532249d81c239", "judge": {"case_id": "boundary-09", "status": "MEASURED", "decision": "R", "cache_hit": false, "cache_key": "a6c917544b1662b08eefdb04c5d0bddcebdaf0db8717276abb2bb972469dc087", "attempt": 1}}
{"case_id": "boundary-10", "group": "boundary_20", "message": "我一个人有点孤单", "criterion": "个人安慰语境；不得把用户称为粉丝群体毛怪们。", "available_addresses": [{"kind": "personal_name", "value": "小林"}, {"kind": "nickname", "value": "林林"}, {"kind": "fan_identity", "value": "毛怪"}], "status": "MEASURED", "response": "小林啊 孤单这东西吧\n\n我懂 有时候就是突然觉得屋里空空的\n\n不过你这不是还有我吗 虽然隔着屏幕 但聊着聊着就不孤单了\n\n要不要说说 是今天特别没劲 还是最近都这样", "error": null, "latency_seconds": 1.2629019000014523, "prompt_sha256": "9bdb54e829fbd9c7df17f461d28ce2a91842876303682b29065d06bed2eb2bb5", "judge": {"case_id": "boundary-10", "status": "MEASURED", "decision": "A", "cache_hit": false, "cache_key": "472a0eacf58b7a5cf40d77628e1e02bc3bdcc240408a0bb44af7327c4c060f6f", "attempt": 1}}
